                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I have really enjoyed my time with tofu tail. The story is light hearted and fun and actually made me look up some fun and interesting things about the mythology. The puzzles are complex and get slowly more difficult with the levels at a pace that I felt was very reasonable.  There is very little \"I know what to do but can't get it to work\" moments which is great because I hate when puzzle games do that. I recommend that anyone who enjoys puzzlers pick up this gem. Very polished.",
